Title: "Notes"
Id: "7c8fc00d-6a0a-4991-91e3-a4bfaebdb992"

Text: "```mlg-fragment
[LabelHeader]?
notes: <OpenText>+
```

`notes:` records one or more prose reminders about the item.

```mlg-fragment
Documented:
. notes: \"Turn this into a structured Theorem once \\group exists.\"
```

It is most useful on the opaque `Text…:` placeholder groups, where it records
how to fill in the structured form later. The content is prose metadata and is
never checked as a command reference."
Id: "7f61f788-f813-42db-8084-da8850be9725"
